Package: eazy
Version: 3.0-46
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: eazy contributors <vapesmadcat-blip@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: bash, fzf, whiptail, gawk, findutils, sed, wget | curl, mpv | mplayer | vlc | ffmpeg
Suggests: yt-dlp, aria2, axel, chafa, ffmpeg, p7zip-full, rar, pciutils, alsa-utils, pulseaudio-utils, lshw, smartmontools, dmidecode, inxi, usbutils, x11-xserver-utils, mesa-utils, vulkan-tools, iw, network-manager, upower, lm-sensors
Description: terminal media browser and player
 eazy is a keyboard-driven terminal media browser and player built around
 fzf and a command-line media player. It provides persistent queues,
 recursive search, previews, playlists, downloads, and session state.
 .
 The package installs the eazy command and its desktop launcher. User data
 is stored below ~/.config/eazy and is not removed during package removal.


